    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people want to help, but they don't get it. they're all playing house in a world that doesn't even matter. it feels like i've already crossed over and i'm just stuck in this waiting room. wouldn't it be more honest to just... stop pretending? to just accept that i don't belong here and move on?",
